# Trial by Ice (sandoria 59): completed by GM (TrialByIce_date 0), the fork by GM: the battlefield's entry holds for a
# completed quest (status >= accepted), and 32001's finish gives the title and the Whisper of Frost in any status (kept
# Lua quirk; battlefieldWin is not read). Gulmama then answers 706 (completed, TrialByIce_date behind), not 709.
char zone=CloisterOfFrost pos=558.5,-0.8,600.0 job=WAR lvl=75
quest Sandoria.TrialByIce completed
keyitem TuningForkOfIce
login
trigger IP_Entrance                       # completed, the fork: the entry menu 32000
update 32000 option=1                     # registered, entered, the fork taken
finish                                    # in the arena
kill DRYAD-3                              # the battlefield won, 32001 opens (canSkipCS 1)
finish                                    # completed: Heir of the Great Ice, the Whisper of Frost all the same
warp -185.5,0.0,110.1 NorthernSanDoria
trigger Gulmama                           # completed, TrialByIce_date 0, the whisper held: 706
finish option=1                           # the quest deleted and begun; the fork
trigger Gulmama                           # accepted, the whisper: 709
finish option=4                           # Rust 'B' Gone: completed
